# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: OpenTTD-OpenMSX.
Package: OpenTTD-OpenMSX
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: any
Depends: OpenTTD
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-openttd
Description: Music for OpenTTD (OpenMSX)
 The free OpenMSX music set for OpenTTD, with the SoundFont OpenTTD
 plays it through. It goes into OpenTTD's application directory.
Build-Map: !OpenTTD/baseset/openmsx -> Apps/Games/!OpenTTD/baseset/openmsx
Build-Map: !OpenTTD/SoundFont -> Apps/Games/!OpenTTD/SoundFont
Build-Map: !OpenTTD/docs/SoundFont-licence -> Apps/Games/!OpenTTD/docs/SoundFont-licence
Build-Map: !OpenTTD/docs/OpenMSX-copyright -> Apps/Games/!OpenTTD/docs/OpenMSX-copyright
Build-Untyped: auto
Build-Notice: OpenMSX for OpenTTD, packaged for PackMan from the release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-openttd/releases
 .
 OpenMSX is under the GNU GPL version 2; the SoundFont keeps its own
 licence. Licences follow.
Build-Copyright: !OpenTTD/baseset/openmsx/license.txt
Build-Copyright: !OpenTTD/docs/OpenMSX-copyright
Build-Copyright: !OpenTTD/docs/SoundFont-licence
